  aciklama: "7. kat, daire 1, Cemal'in dairesi (g\xF6zlem). Sahanl\u0131kta d\xF6rt
    '13' kap\u0131s\u0131, ger\xE7e\u011Fi Cemal'in notundaki farklarla bulunur;
    yanl\u0131\u015F kap\u0131 bir olay tetikler. Elektriksiz daire, yedi kilit:
    banyo (mente\u015Fe), salon (do\u011Fum g\xFCn\xFC 1107, n\xFCfus c\xFCzdan\u0131
    banyoda), kiler (anahtar b\xFCfede), mutfak (kiler kolu), Oda A (k\u0131r\u0131k
    anahtar), Oda B (fosforlu 0913), sand\u0131k (levye) -> kat\u0131n anahtar\u0131."
